00:09:50,399 --> 00:09:56,399
Blade: Trinity is a action, horror, science fiction
film directed by David S. Goyer.

3
00:14:45,599 --> 00:14:51,599
For years, Blade has fought against the vampires in the cover of the night.

4
00:19:40,799 --> 00:19:46,799
But now, after falling into the crosshairs of the FBI, he is forced out into the daylight, where he is driven
to join forces with a clan of human vampire hunters he never knew existed—The Nightstalkers.

5
00:24:36,000 --> 00:24:42,000
Together with Abigail and Hannibal, two deftly trained Nightstalkers, Blade follows a trail of
blood to the ancient creature that is also hunting him—the original vampire, Dracula.

6
00:29:31,199 --> 00:29:37,199
Eric Brooks / Blade, played by Wesley Snipes.

7
00:34:26,400 --> 00:34:32,400
Abigail Whistler, played by Jessica Biel.

8
00:39:21,599 --> 00:39:27,599
Hannibal King, played by Ryan Reynolds.

9
